   <widget class="QCheckBox" name="p_toa">
    <property name="geometry">
     <rect>
      <x>11</x>
      <y>123</y>
      <width>416</width>
      <height>26</height>
     </rect>
    </property>
    <property name="toolTip">
     <string>Compute the index on top-of-atmosphere reflectance instead of on the raw DNs: each band is calibrated with the scene's MTL (gain, offset and sun elevation), as Satellite &gt; Remote sensing &gt; Calibration does. Available only when the MTL is at hand: a .vrt of Landsat band files with their â€¦_MTL.txt beside them, or a Band cube (which carries the MTL in its metadata). A Level-2 SR band gives its surface reflectance.</string>
    </property>
    <property name="text">
     <string>Top of atmosphere reflectance (from the MTL)</string>
    </property>
   </widget>  </widget>
  <widget class="QGroupBox" name="gb_output">
   <property name="geometry">
    <rect>
     <x>11</x>
     <y>279</y>
     <width>438</width>
     <height>128</height>
    </rect>
   </property>
   <property name="title">
    <string>Output</string>
   </property>
   <widget class="QComboBox" name="p_output">
    <property name="toolTip">
     <string>What the index is turned into:
- Index values: the index itself, a grid (NDVI runs from -1 to 1).
- Threshold: the same grid with every pixel below Threshold blanked (NaN), e.g. NDVI 0.2 keeps the vegetation.
- Mask (≥): a black/white image, white where the index ≥ Threshold, e.g. MNDWI 0 = a water mask.
- Mask (&lt;): the reverse, white where the index &lt; Threshold.
- Classes: an image of classes 0-3 cut at the Class separators.</string>
    </property>
    <property name="refresh" stdset="0">
     <bool>true</bool>
    </property>
    <property name="geometry">
     <rect>
      <x>11</x>
      <y>27</y>
      <width>416</width>
      <height>26</height>
     </rect>
    </property>
    <item>
     <property name="text">
      <string>Index values (grid)</string>
     </property>
    </item>
    <item>
     <property name="text">
      <string>Threshold: NaN below it (grid)</string>
     </property>
    </item>
    <item>
     <property name="text">
      <string>Mask (≥ threshold)</string>
     </property>
    </item>
    <item>
     <property name="text">
      <string>Mask (&lt; threshold)</string>
     </property>
    </item>
    <item>
     <property name="text">
      <string>Classes (up to 3 separators)</string>
     </property>
    </item>
   </widget>
